;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\雷雨.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "3000" "WAIT"}
{PLAYMOVIE "雨1.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "100" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n100\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\荒田山道夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>The lightning is all I have to go on.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The sun is long gone, and the storm clouds make the night even darker than usual.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The lightning that now and then rips through the air is the only light showing me the way.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
By the time I reached the entrance to the Arata settlement, it was already around 8 or 9 p.m.<PG>
I can't tell the exact time, but thanks to the mountain seclusion, my body clock should be pretty accurate.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I allow for a range of 8 to 9 p.m., I can hardly be wrong.<PG>
I tried to act as calmly as I could.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When I was about to act on my anger, the last of my self-control held me back.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The true face of that self-control―
{PAUSE ""}
was fear.<PG>
If I let my anger drive me to rescue <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> and Goto, I'd only end up cut down by <STYLE ID="2">Chiga-nee</STYLE> or <STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So that wouldn't happen, I made fear my ally.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\深淵からの呼び声.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\女神\荒田駅外ノーマル.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Back then, the first thing I did was check every inch around Arata Station before it got dark.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Maybe <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> and Goto were somewhere near the station―
{PAUSE ""}
so I checked that possibility first: the station platform―
{PAUSE ""}
the roof of the train―
{PAUSE ""}
the storage shed―
{PAUSE ""}
the tops of the nearby trees―
{PAUSE ""}
I searched them all.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I searched until sunset, and concluded that <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> and Goto had been taken to the Arata settlement.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even while walking the mountain path, I spared no effort feeling out the presences around me.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\dark_attack.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱ナイフ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜ナイフ1.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "000" "$0000FF" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "33" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I can never again let <STYLE ID="2">Chiga-nee</STYLE> or <STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE> get around behind me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If they get behind me next time, there's no guarantee I'll live.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Those two will pick up my blatant bloodlust.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物2,人物1" "33" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Whenever I lost the path in the dark, I waited for the next flash of lightning and hurried on, scanning as far ahead as I could.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If not for the lightning, I'd never have made it to the settlement.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\雷雨.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "3000" "WAIT"}
{PLAYMOVIE "雨1.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "100" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n150\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\荒田集落1夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n150\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I hide behind a tree and keep a careful watch on the settlement.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Still no sign of anyone.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n10000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{STOPSND "SE" "10000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
At last the rain is letting up.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's been coming down nonstop since morning, and my ears have gotten completely used to the sound of the rain.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\z50逆.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
With the sound of the rain gone, now the 'sound of silence' starts to fill my ears.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The sound of a silence that the sound-word "<STYLE ID="4" RUBY="しん">forest</STYLE>" fits perfectly.<PG>
As the sound of the rain fades, my five senses grow sharper too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Little by little, I can sense the human presences the rain had been blocking out.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
............
{PAUSE ""}
There's someone.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Right now, there are people in this settlement.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Lots of them.<PG>
Hm? That's―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n798\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">Kotaro-san</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="2">Chiga-nee</STYLE> have come out of the Niimura house.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And,
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "$0000FF" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\女神\ミイラ能面.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
between the two of them, they're carrying out a person dressed in a Noh mask and old, worn red robes.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It looks awfully light for a human, so it must be the Verde mummy.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Where are they taking it...?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\荒田集落1夜.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The two of them went off not toward me, but in the exact opposite direction.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That way is toward the graveyard clearing, or the meeting hall.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
They don't seem to have noticed me.<PG>
First, what I do next.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'll sneak into the Niimura house now and check whether <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> and Goto are there.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
While I'm at it, I'll eat something, even a little, and change out of these <STYLE ID="6" RUBY="ぬ">wet</STYLE> clothes.<PG>
I don't feel that tired right now, but all I've eaten is some rabbit meat this morning.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Once the tension breaks, the exhaustion is sure to hit my body all at once.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'll decide right now, in detail, when I rest and how.<PG>
But what bothers me here is <STYLE ID="7">Sakura-san</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">Sakura-san</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE> didn't come out of the Niimura house.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Which means those two are acting separately―doing something else.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If anything, could they be standing guard over <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="8">Goto</STYLE>?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
They've surely guessed I'd come to rescue <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> and Goto.<PG>
So does that mean I've been lured here?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Using <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> and Goto as bait, to draw me in here...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In that case, they could've just attacked me on the train.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Is there some purpose behind it?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There's no way I'll figure it out by thinking about it, though...<PG>
First, I'll sneak into the Niimura house as planned.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Taking more care than ever not to run into <STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE>, of all people, I'll track down <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> and Goto.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When I'm in the kitchen I'll eat something, even a single bite, and once I'm upstairs I'll change clothes fast.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> and Goto aren't there, I'll finish all this within 5 minutes, get out of the Niimura house right away, and search the next place.<PG>
If <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> and Goto are there, we get out of the settlement fast.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Though moving on foot, the three of us, is a pretty big risk...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\砂利を走る.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "800" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
I go in not by the road but through the trees that surround the settlement.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The rain stopping has made presences easier to sense, and that goes for the other side too.<PG>
{STOPSND "VOICE" "500" "PASS"}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家庭夜.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―Getting onto the Niimura property was relatively easy.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Rather than easy, should I say it was a letdown?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But going in through the front door or the veranda here is dangerous.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Because the lights in the house are on.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I decide to get in through the window of my room on the second floor.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I hope it's unlocked...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家2階.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Once again, getting in was easy.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I need to hurry and get out of these <STYLE ID="6" RUBY="ぬ">wet</STYLE> clothes.<PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\swish.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
The only thing in the room that's different from this afternoon is that the Verde mummy is gone.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So what <STYLE ID="5">Kotaro-san</STYLE> and company carried out a moment ago must've been the Verde mummy after all.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The blood that was <STYLE ID="9" RUBY="したた">dripping</STYLE> from the mummy and my blood-<STYLE ID="6" RUBY="ぬ">soaked</STYLE> phone are just as they were this afternoon.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My things don't look like they've been touched either.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家2階廊下.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I change quickly and search the second floor.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's just a matter of <STYLE ID="10" RUBY="のぞ">peeking</STYLE> into each room.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I didn't mean to let my guard down, but the search of the second floor was over in 30 seconds.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For some reason there was no sense of anyone, so I lost any urge to be careful.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家居間.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―No sign of anyone on the first floor, either.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But a certain smell is hanging in the living room.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's the kind of smell I'd been worried about: one that loosens your tension.<PG>
Normally, while a person feels tension, all their instinctive drives are cut off.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Say you take a fatal wound on a battlefield: appetite, the urge to sleep, and sex drive are all suppressed to the limit, and instinct demands nothing but staying alive.<PG>
At such times the human body seeks survival so hard that it forgets not only its instinctive drives but, in some cases, even serious injuries like broken bones.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If pain gets in the way and you can't walk, that's nothing but an obstacle to survival.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So the body shuts out those obstacles―pain and instinctive drives alike.<PG>
That's exactly the state I'm in right now.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No... to be exact, I was in that state until a moment ago.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There are ways to force instinctive drives to kick in.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For sex drive, show someone an erotic scene; for sleep, put a soft bed right in front of them, or have them breathe in an aroma, and the tension eases.<PG>
And for appetite, you get the same effect just by smelling a <STYLE ID="11" RUBY="たんび">ravishing</STYLE> aroma that whets the appetite and stimulates the salivary glands.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I never expected the living room to be filled with the smell of food this fragrant and <STYLE ID="12" RUBY="ほうじゅん">rich</STYLE>.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\煮る.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\女神\煮物.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
On the living-room table sit a portable gas burner and a big pot, with hot steam rising from it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It looks like a stew of meat, eggs and vegetables.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's a simple dish, but it's tempting to someone like me, who hasn't eaten anything since this morning, has run all over and been pelted by rain, and is out of strength.<PG>
More than anything, I haven't had a properly cooked meal in a whole 2 years.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Let alone a dish that smells of soy sauce and sugar like this―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My mouth fills with saliva, and my stomach starts screaming.
